{"id": "e42bf7e5-94b4-4874-ac83-6e58576165d9", "slug": "vortex-studio-digital-identities-2", "title": "Vortex Studio | Digital Identities", "description": "Vortex Studio Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Vortex Studio | Digital Identities\"\ndescription: \"Vortex Studio Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF4A1C\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FF4A1C\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#1F2937\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Vortex Studio | Digital Identities\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 57; favorites: 6; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, animated, cta, bento, branding.\n## Overview\nVortex Studio Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nVortex Studio Crafting digital identities and immersive platforms for visionary tech innovators. Start a project Digital strategy Brand identity Web platforms Motion design 3D experiences Vortex Studio . Systems Archite…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Crafting digital identities and immersive platforms for visionary tech innovators.; Vortex Studio .; Constructing scalable frameworks that blend form with uncompromising function.; Structural Precision; Transparent Ecosystems; Infinite Scalability.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF4A1C, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FF4A1C, background #FFFFFF, surface #1F2937, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Vortex Studio | Digital Identities</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #050505;\n        }\n\n        /* High-end Agency Diagonal Lines */\n        .bg-diagonal-dark {\n            background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n                -45deg,\n                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 0,\n                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px,\n                transparent 1px,\n                transparent 40px\n            );\n        }\n\n        .bg-diagonal-light {\n            background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n                -45deg,\n                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03) 0,\n                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03) 1px,\n                transparent 1px,\n                transparent 40px\n            );\n        }\n\n        /* Custom Animation Classes */\n        .reveal-element {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(20px);\n            filter: blur(10px);\n            transition: all 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n            will-change: transform, opacity, filter;\n        }\n\n        .reveal-element.is-visible {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n            filter: blur(0);\n        }\n\n        .reveal-right {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateX(20px);\n            filter: blur(5px);\n            transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n        }\n\n        .reveal-right.is-visible {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateX(0);\n            filter: blur(0);\n        }\n\n        /* Word by word animation styling */\n        .word-wrap {\n            display: inline-block;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n\n        .word-inner {\n            display: inline-block;\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(100%) rotate(2deg);\n            transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n            will-change: transform, opacity;\n        }\n\n        .is-visible .word-inner {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0) rotate(0);\n        }\n\n        /* Giant text special animation */\n        .giant-text-anim {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: scale(0.95) translateY(20px);\n            filter: blur(20px);\n            transition: all 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n        }\n\n        .is-visible.giant-text-anim {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: scale(1) translateY(0);\n            filter: blur(0);\n        }\n\n        /* Smooth background parallax */\n        #bg-container {\n            transition: transform 0.1s linear;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n\n        /* Intricate Buttons */\n        .intricate-btn-light {\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f3f4f6 100%);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 1),\n                inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05),\n                0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),\n                0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n        }\n\n        .intricate-btn-dark {\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1f2937 0%, #030712 100%);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15),\n                inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),\n                0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2),\n                0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .btn-dynamic::before, .intricate-btn-dark::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            border-radius: 9999px;\n            padding: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), rgba(255,255,255,0.6));\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .btn-dynamic:hover::before, .intricate-btn-dark:hover::before {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        /* Premium Gradient Border Cards */\n        .gradient-border-card {\n            position: relative;\n            background: #f9fafb;\n        }\n        .gradient-border-card::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            padding: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.1), rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.06));\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-white antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-white selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- Background Layer with Parallax -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 bg-black overflow-hidden pointer-events-none\">\n        <div id=\"bg-container\" class=\"absolute inset-[-5%] w-[110%] h-[110%]\">\n            <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779249388197-d71f8ec9-1224-445c-a60f-2dcc69a48e36.png\" alt=\"Background Portrait\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_30%] opacity-50 grayscale mix-blend-lighten\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779249388197-d71f8ec9-1224-445c-a60f-2dcc69a48e36.png\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/60 via-transparent to-black/90\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/80 via-black/20 to-black/80\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Stylish Diagonal Lines Overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-diagonal-dark z-10 mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Interface -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen justify-between w-full mx-auto\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"flex justify-between items-center w-full p-6 md:p-10 lg:p-12 reveal-element\" style=\"transition-delay: 100ms;\">\n            <!-- SVG Logo Branding -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer group\">\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"text-white group-hover:rotate-90 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out\">\n                    <path d=\"M12 2L2 22H22L12 2Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n                    <path d=\"M12 10L7 20H17L12 10Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n                </svg>\n                <span class=\"font-medium tracking-tight text-base md:text-lg\">Vortex Studio</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Menu Toggle -->\n            <button class=\"text-white hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors p-2 -mr-2\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" width=\"28\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Middle Content Grid -->\n        <main class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 px-6 md:px-10 lg:px-12 flex-grow items-center w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto py-12 lg:py-0\">\n\n            <!-- Left Side: Headline & CTA -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 xl:col-span-6 flex flex-col items-start gap-8 lg:gap-10\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-[1.15] text-gray-100 max-w-[20ch] animate-words\">\n                    Crafting digital identities and immersive platforms for visionary tech innovators.\n                </h1>\n\n                <div class=\"reveal-element\" style=\"transition-delay: 600ms;\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-dynamic intricate-btn-light group relative inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 py-3 md:px-7 md:py-3.5 text-black text-sm md:text-base font-medium transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]\">\n                        <span class=\"relative z-10 tracking-tight\">Start a project</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"relative z-10 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Side: Services List -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9 xl:col-span-3 xl:col-start-10 flex flex-col items-end gap-1 text-right mt-8 lg:mt-0\">\n                <ul class=\"flex flex-col text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-gray-300 tracking-tight w-full\">\n                    <li class=\"reveal-right py-1 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default\" style=\"transition-delay: 400ms;\">Digital strategy</li>\n                    <li class=\"reveal-right py-1 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default\" style=\"transition-delay: 450ms;\">Brand identity</li>\n                    <li class=\"reveal-right py-1 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default\" style=\"transition-delay: 500ms;\">Web platforms</li>\n                    <li class=\"reveal-right py-1 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default\" style=\"transition-delay: 550ms;\">Motion design</li>\n                    <li class=\"reveal-right py-1 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default\" style=\"transition-delay: 600ms;\">3D experiences</li>\n                </ul>\n                <div class=\"mt-6 reveal-element\" style=\"transition-delay: 800ms;\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:target-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-gray-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Giant Typography -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center items-end px-4 pt-12 pb-24 md:pb-32 pointer-events-none mt-auto overflow-hidden\">\n            <h2 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-[0.8] text-center whitespace-nowrap giant-text-anim\" style=\"font-size: clamp(4rem, 15vw, 18rem);\">\n                Vortex Studio<span class=\"text-[#FF4A1C] -ml-[0.02em]\">.</span>\n            </h2>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Second Section (Light Mode) -->\n    <section class=\"relative z-20 w-full bg-white rounded-t-3xl flex flex-col items-center pt-20 pb-32 px-6 md:px-10 lg:px-12 text-black shadow-[0_-10px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] overflow-hidden\">\n\n        <!-- Stylish Diagonal Lines Overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-diagonal-light z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"max-w-[1600px] w-full mx-auto relative z-10\">\n\n            <!-- Section Header & Hierarchy -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-8 mb-12\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-2xl\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-400 mb-4 block reveal-element\">Systems Architecture</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-tight animate-words\">\n                        Constructing scalable frameworks that blend form with uncompromising function.\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"reveal-element\" style=\"transition-delay: 200ms;\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"intricate-btn-dark group relative inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full text-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]\">\n                        <span class=\"relative z-10 tracking-tight\">View case studies</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"relative z-10 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Divider -->\n            <hr class=\"border-t border-gray-200 w-full mb-12 reveal-element\" style=\"transition-delay: 300ms;\">\n\n            <!-- Content Grid with Gradient Borders -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                <!-- Card 1 -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 reveal-element\" style=\"transition-delay: 400ms;\">\n                    <div class=\"gradient-border-card w-full aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group bg-white\">\n                        <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779249415045-642febe0-c2f3-4d72-aea4-8cafaad74b94.png\" alt=\"Deconstructed Pyramid Architecture\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-105\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779249415045-642febe0-c2f3-4d72-aea4-8cafaad74b94.png\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight mb-2\">Structural Precision</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">Rigorous engineering meets forward-thinking design to establish foundational digital infrastructure.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2 -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 reveal-element\" style=\"transition-delay: 500ms;\">\n                    <div class=\"gradient-border-card w-full aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group bg-white\">\n                        <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779249440791-4193f9e2-a6ee-4dd2-8f3e-a57d5cd05ea3.png\" alt=\"Modern Glass Villa\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-105\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779249440791-4193f9e2-a6ee-4dd2-8f3e-a57d5cd05ea3.png\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight mb-2\">Transparent Ecosystems</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">Creating seamless environments that invite interaction and foster profound user engagement.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3 -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 reveal-element\" style=\"transition-delay: 600ms;\">\n                    <div class=\"gradient-border-card w-full aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group bg-white\">\n                        <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779249470625-163a17ac-0914-49c4-8462-257d62128688.png\" alt=\"Ring-Shaped Futuristic City\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-105\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779249470625-163a17ac-0914-49c4-8462-257d62128688.png\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight mb-2\">Infinite Scalability</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">Architecting cyclic systems designed for continuous evolution in a rapidly shifting landscape.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n\n            // 1. Word by Word Splitter Utility\n            const animateWords = document.querySelectorAll('.animate-words');\n\n            animateWords.forEach((el) => {\n                const text = el.textContent.trim();\n                const words = text.split(/\\s+/);\n                el.textContent = '';\n\n                words.forEach((word, index) => {\n                    const wrap = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrap.className = 'word-wrap';\n\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.className = 'word-inner';\n                    inner.textContent = word;\n                    inner.style.transitionDelay = `${index * 40 + 200}ms`;\n\n                    wrap.appendChild(inner);\n                    el.appendChild(wrap);\n\n                    if (index < words.length - 1) {\n                        el.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '));\n                    }\n                });\n\n                el.classList.add('observe-me');\n            });\n\n            // 2. Intersection Observer for Scroll Animations\n            const observerOptions = {\n                root: null,\n                rootMargin: '0px',\n                threshold: 0.1\n            };\n\n            const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries, observer) => {\n                entries.forEach(entry => {\n                    if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n                        entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');\n                        observer.unobserve(entry.target);\n                    }\n                });\n            }, observerOptions);\n\n            document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-element, .reveal-right, .giant-text-anim, .observe-me').forEach((el) => {\n                observer.observe(el);\n            });\n\n            // 3. Dynamic Mouse Parallax for Background\n            const bgContainer = document.getElementById('bg-container');\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let currentX = 0;\n            let currentY = 0;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                mouseX = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 2;\n                mouseY = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 2;\n            });\n\n            function animateBackground() {\n                currentX += (mouseX - currentX) * 0.05;\n                currentY += (mouseY - currentY) * 0.05;\n\n                if (bgContainer) {\n                    bgContainer.style.transform = `translate(${currentX * -1.5}%, ${currentY * -1.5}%) scale(1.05)`;\n                }\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateBackground);\n            }\n\n            if(window.matchMedia(\"(hover: hover)\").matches) {\n                animateBackground();\n            } else {\n                bgContainer.style.transform = \"scale(1.05)\";\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "vortex-studio-digital-identities-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/vortex-studio-digital-identities-2.jpg", "source_name": "vortex-studio-digital-identities-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 146, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T11:48:27.533948+00:00"}